* PalmPilot module_en_2; extracted passive topology, explicit approximations
VDD vdd 0 PWL(0 0 1m 0 2m 3.3)
Rpull vdd en 10100.0
Cen en 0 8e-07
Vreset ctl 0 PULSE(0 1 80m 1u 1u 10m 1)
Sreset en 0 ctl 0 BTN
.model BTN SW(Ron=1 Roff=1e12 Vt=.5 Vh=.05)

.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-8
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 1u 130m 0 1u
wrdata /Users/anoof/Documents/Codex/2026-11-17/https-github-com-samiurr10-gesture-controlled-2/work/gesture-controlled-drone/hardware/simulation/results/module_en_2.dat v(en) v(vdd)
quit
.endc
.end
